  "text": "Emergency Vet in Concord, CA | SAGE Veterinary Centers\nSkip to Primary Content\nGive Us a Call\nEmergency\nEmergency\nContact Us\nContact Us\nWho We Are\nAbout Us\nGiving Back\nShare Your Story\nOur Team - Campbell\nOur Team - Concord\nOur Team - Dublin\nOur Team - Redwood City\nOur Team - San Francisco\nServices\nView all Services\nCampbell Services\nConcord Services\nDublin Services\nRedwood City Services\nSan Francisco Services\nFor Pet Owners\nFor Pet Owners\nSelf-Service Portal\nAppointment Information\nOnline Pharmacy\nGrief Support\nPet Owner FAQs\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Veterinarians\nE-Learning Portal\nClinical Trials\nRequest Records\nVeterinarian FAQs\nCareers\nGive Us a Call\nEmergency\nContact Us\nWelcome to SAGE Concord\nYour Neighborhood Pet Care Experts\nCall Us\nSAGE Veterinary Centers - Concord\n24 HOUR EMERGENCY VETERINARY & SPECIALTY SERVICES\nSF Bay Area’s most respected veterinary specialty and emergency care, proudly serving Concord, Pleasant Hill, Walnut Creek, and the surrounding areas with the highest standard of compassionate, collaborative care that improves the lives of pets and their people.\nRequest an Appointment\nAt SAGE Veterinary Centers, we understand that your pet is family. That’s why we’re committed to providing exceptional emergency and specialty care when your pet needs it most. With a team of highly trained specialists across disciplines like Surgery, Oncology, and Critical Care, we ensure every patient receives the individualized attention they deserve. Our hospitals are open 24/7 for emergencies, providing you with peace of mind and access to life-saving care around the clock.\nWhat sets SAGE apart is our focus on\ncontinuity of care.\nWith multiple specialties under one roof, your pet can seamlessly see a variety of experts in a single visit, ensuring a collaborative and efficient approach to treatment. This unique integration allows us to provide the highest level of care possible, tailored to your pet’s needs. At SAGE, we’re not just here for today — we’re here for every step of your pet’s healthcare journey.\nProcedures and Services\nComprehensive Care Options\nSAGE Centers Specializes in many areas of Veterinary Medicine using the most current knowledge and treatments available to ensure the highest standards of care for your best friend.\nView Our Services Page >\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nEmergency\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nAbout SAGE Concord\nWho We Are\nWhile our facilities feature state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment and surgical tools, we pride ourselves on providing compassionate, loving care, for pets and their families alike.\nMeet Our Team\nView All Doctors\nSara Johns\nDVM, DACVIM\nView Profile\nTomo Wiggans\nDVM, MEng, DACVO\nView Profile\nJack Meagher\nVMD, DACVECC\nView Profile\nSara Johns\nDVM, DACVIM\nView Profile\nTomo Wiggans\nDVM, MEng, DACVO\nView Profile\nJack Meagher\nVMD, DACVECC\nView Profile\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(925) 627-7243\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nFind a Location\nServices\nSelf-Service Portal\nOnline Pharmacy\nContact Us\nEmergency\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nCareers\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
